<!--
  Default locale: English (LANGUAGE-LOCALIZATION-STANDARD). Wave 2 locales
  live in values-de/, values-es/, values-b+zh+Hans/, values-hi/, values-ar/.

  The state strings mirror the Voice UI Kit catalogs so the Compose surface
  and the web element say the same thing:
    speechkit_assistant_state_listening  -> sk.voice.state.capturing
    speechkit_assistant_state_processing -> sk.voice.state.processing
    speechkit_assistant_action_retry     -> sk.voice.denied.retry
  Source of truth: clients/typescript/packages/voice-ui/locales/*.json.
  Like those catalogs, the non-English values are machine-drafted and still
  await human review.
-->
